    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac{10}{\\sqrt2}\\text{ cm}$; use $\\cos45^\\circ=\\dfrac{x}{10}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos45^\\circ&=\\frac{x}{10}\\\\\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}&=\\frac{x}{10}\\\\x&=\\frac{10}{\\sqrt2}\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
